--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

KhataGo is a single, fully offline Android application. It links only the following
open-source libraries, each under the Apache License 2.0. There is no analytics SDK,
no advertising SDK, no crash reporter, no billing library and no network stack — the
application manifest does not request the INTERNET permission, and that absence is the
guarantee, not a setting.

  * Kotlin standard library and kotlinx-coroutines / kotlinx-serialization
    (org.jetbrains.kotlin, org.jetbrains.kotlinx) — Apache-2.0
  * AndroidX Core (core-ktx), AppCompat, Activity Compose, Splashscreen — Apache-2.0
  * Jetpack Compose runtime, foundation and Material 3 (androidx.compose.*) — Apache-2.0
  * Material Icons core + extended (androidx.compose.material:material-icons-core / -extended) — Apache-2.0
  * Navigation Compose (androidx.navigation) — Apache-2.0
  * Room runtime, ktx and Common (androidx.room) — Apache-2.0
  * Android framework SharedPreferences (used only for the app-lock store, which is deliberately
    outside the database so that a backup or a data wipe can never carry or erase it) — Apache-2.0
  * Biometric (androidx.biometric) — Apache-2.0
  * WorkManager (androidx.work) — Apache-2.0
  * Lifecycle Runtime / ViewModel Compose (androidx.lifecycle) — Apache-2.0

Test-only dependencies (never shipped in an APK): JUnit 4, kotlinx-coroutines-test,
Turbine, androidx.arch.core:core-testing, androidx.room:room-testing,
androidx.test:core / androidx.test.ext:junit and Robolectric.

The full license text of each dependency ships inside the app's own dependency graph; the
above list is the attribution that matters for redistribution: every one of them permits
redistribution under Apache-2.0 provided this notice and their notices are retained.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Brand assets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The launcher icon, splash mark and wordmark under `app/src/main/res/` are generated from
the master artwork in `assets_src/brand/`. The checked-in master is an original placeholder
produced for this repository so that the build is self-contained; it is not the final brand
art. To substitute official artwork, replace `assets_src/brand/flat_square.png` and
`logo_wordmark.png`, then re-run `assets_src/brand/regenerate_icons.sh`. See docs/DESIGN.md.

