No warranty of financial correctness
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

KhataGo is a record-keeping tool. It does not connect to any bank, does not verify any
balance, and is not an accounting or legal record of debt. Every number it shows is derived
from what its user typed. See docs/MONEY.md for the arithmetic rules it implements.
